PRINTFORML a. 직접적인 원인 (사망을 초래한 최종 질병 또는 상태)
PRINTFORM		- 
SELECTCASE KilledWith:ARG:0
	CASE "OD"
		deathCause '= "DRUG OVERDOSE"
	CASE "BirthFail"
		deathCause '= "BIRTH COMPLICATIONS"
	CASE "BigPain"
		PRINTFORM 치명적인 고통 쇼크
		deathType '= "accident"
	CASE "BigSegs"
		PRINTFORM OVEREXERTION
		deathType '= "accident"
	CASE "SmiteGod"
		PRINTFORM ELECTROCUTION
	CASE "Chupacabra"
		PRINTFORM 다발성 물린 상처
	CASE "DieForMe", "Shimachau", "Cheat"
		PRINTFORM 뇌 기능 정지
		deathType '= "natural"
	CASE "Pitfall"
		PRINTFORM 목 골절
		;FALLING
		deathType '= "accident"
	CASE "tornado"
		PRINTFORM 장기 파열, 출혈
		;FRACTURES
		;STRUCK BY DEBRIS AND FLUNG BY TORNADO
		;MOD_PRE = has been minced to pieces by a tornado
	CASE "fallen tree"
		PRINTFORM 타격성 외상
		;STRUCK BY FALLING TREE
		;MOD_PRE = has been been obliterated by a fallen tree
	CASE "debris"
		PRINTFORM 타격 외상
		;STRUCK BY DEBRIS IN NATURAL DISASTER
		;MOD_PRE = became a victim of a natural disaster
	CASE "MarisaSuicide"
		PRINTFORM EXPLOSION
		deathType '= "suicide"
	CASE "Surgery"
		;HEART FAILURE
		PRINTFORM 필드 수술 실패
		deathType '= "accident"
	CASE "asphyxiation"
		PRINTFORM ASPHYXIATION
	CASEELSE
		deathHediffCount = DT_SELECT("Hediff", @"chara = {ARG} and type = {LastHediff:ARG % 100}", "severity DESC", woundList)
		IF deathHediffCount != 0
			FOR LOCAL, 0, deathHediffCount && !GROUPMATCH(LastHediff:ARG % 100,7,34,38)
			LOCALS '= @"%TOUPPER(BDY_PART_NAME(DT_CELL_GET(@"Hediff", woundList:LOCAL, "part", 1)))%、"
			IF STRFIND(deathPartList,LOCALS) == -1
				deathPartList += LOCALS
				IF STRCOUNT(deathPartList,"、") >= 5
					deathPartList += "ETC."
					BREAK
				ENDIF
			ENDIF
			NEXT
		ENDIF
		SELECTCASE LastHediff:ARG % 100
			CASE 1
				IF deathHediffCount > 3
					deathCause '= "MULTIPLE GUNSHOT WOUNDS"
				ELSE
					deathCause '= "GUNSHOT WOUND"
				ENDIF
				;GUNSHOT WOUND ON HEAD
				deathInterval '= "SECOND(S)"
			CASE 2
				IF deathHediffCount > 3
					deathCause '= "MULTIPLE STAB WOUNDS"
				ELSE
					deathCause '= "STAB WOUND"
				ENDIF
				;GUNSHOT WOUND ON HEAD
				deathInterval '= "SECOND(S)"
			CASE 3, 4
				PRINTFORM 화상 상처
			CASE 6
				;MULTIPLE BLUNT-FORCE TRAUMA
				;ON NECK, HEAD, CHEST, CROTCH, LEFT LEG, RIGHT LEG, LEFT ARM, RIGHT ARM, ABDOMEN
				;ON NECK, HEAD, CHEST, CROTCH, LEFT LEG, ETC.
				PRINTFORM 타격성 외상
				deathInterval '= "SECOND(S)"
			CASE 11
				deathType '= "natural"
				PRINTFORM CARCINOMA
				deathInterval '= "WEEK(S)"
			CASE 7
				PRINTFORM ELECTROCUTION
				deathInterval '= "SECOND(S)"
			CASE 8
				PRINTFORM 외부 부패
				deathInterval '= "MINUTE(S)"
			CASE 34
				PRINTFORM ASPHYXIATION
				deathInterval '= "MINUTE(S)"
			CASE 35
				PRINTFORM FROSTBITE
				deathInterval '= "DAY(S)"
			CASE 36
				PRINTFORM 정신증 유발 신경 손상
				deathInterval '= "SECOND(S)"
			CASE 38
				PRINTFORM EXPLOSION
				deathInterval '= "SECOND(S)"
			CASEELSE
				PRINTFORM %GET_STR(ARG, "Hediff", (LastHediff:ARG % 100), "名前")%
				deathInterval '= "DAY(S)"
		ENDSELECT
ENDSELECT
PRINTFORMS deathCause
SIF STRLENS(deathPartList)
	PRINTFORMS " ON "+LIST_IN_STRING(deathPartList,,", ")
PRINTFORML  (%TOUPPER(deathInterval)%)
PRINTFORML 즉각적인 원인으로 이어지는 조건을 순차적으로 나열한다.
